<div id="contact-disclaimer-modal" class="hidden fixed inset-0 z-[100] overflow-y-auto bg-slate-900/70 backdrop-blur-sm flex items-center justify-center p-4 transition-opacity duration-200">
  <div class="relative bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-2xl max-w-lg w-full p-6 sm:p-7 text-slate-800 border border-slate-200/80 space-y-5 animate-in fade-in zoom-in-95 duration-200">
    
    <!-- Close Icon -->
    <button type="button" id="btn-close-disclaimer" class="absolute top-4 right-4 text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-600 p-1.5 rounded-lg hover:bg-slate-100 transition-colors" aria-label="Fechar">
      <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12"></path>
      </svg>
    </button>

    <!-- Header & Icon -->
    <div class="flex items-start gap-3.5">
      <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-blue-100 text-[#093892] flex items-center justify-center font-black text-xl shrink-0 shadow-inner">
        🛡️
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 leading-snug">
          Segurança e Contato com a Oficina
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium">Leia antes de solicitar seu orçamento</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Body text -->
    <div class="space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed bg-slate-50 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200/80">
      <p>
        O <strong>Melhores Mecânicos</strong> é um guia público que aproxima motoristas de oficinas com base em cadastros públicos da Receita Federal. <strong>Não intermediamos pagamentos nem cobramos comissões sobre os serviços.</strong>
      </p>
      
      <div class="p-3 bg-blue-50 rounded-lg border border-blue-200/90 text-[#093892] font-medium text-xs space-y-1">
        <span class="font-bold text-[#093892] block flex items-center gap-1">
          <span>🔒</span> Dica de Segurança Importante:
        </span>
        <p class="text-slate-700 leading-normal">
          Solicite sempre a <strong>Ordem de Serviço (OS)</strong> detalhada antes de autorizar qualquer reparo ou transferência, conferindo peças e mão de obra acordadas.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Action Buttons -->
    <div class="pt-2 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-stretch sm:items-center gap-3">
      <button type="button" id="btn-accept-disclaimer" class="w-full bg-[#093892] hover:bg-[#072d75] text-white font-extrabold text-xs sm:text-sm py-3 px-5 rounded-xl shadow-md shadow-[#093892]/20 transition-all text-center flex items-center justify-center gap-2 cursor-pointer">
        <span>✅</span>
        <span>Entendi e quero ver o contato</span>
      </button>
      <button type="button" id="btn-cancel-disclaimer" class="w-full sm:w-auto bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 text-slate-700 font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm py-3 px-4 rounded-xl transition-colors text-center cursor-pointer">
        Cancelar
      </button>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>
